{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05这类短停留段落里，感受词堆得偏密，扫读压力明显高于X；个别比喻如“灵魂飘出躯壳”也略显用力。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮关键词让我更快抓住每段的人物状态和心理转折，感受文字又能随着音乐进程逐步出现，水波、小船、摇荡、浪潮等意象也把开头的忐忑、中间的失衡和结尾的安定串成了连续的体验。X在心理因果解释上更完整，尤其是害怕给对方负担、想把喜欢藏回去的自我保护动机，Y压缩后少了一层；但整体而言，Y的音乐对应更具体，情绪变化也更细腻，观众更容易同时听见音乐、看见画面并理解人物。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d7dfc03-fb7a-47fb-9eec-a81d6ef7dfdd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T123743015064Z", "elapsed_seconds": 148.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T12:40:11.450316+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a19e6e2c3e9468e1df4c01e30899400f077d7f0f5d49cac26beb13ffec9bb604", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt